# Note: data/generated/boot_config.tres is a DERIVED artifact but is COMMITTED
# (tracked) so a clean checkout / exported .app boots without a build step. A
# pure-Python freshness gate (test_data_seam.py) asserts it matches a fresh build,
# keeping the JSON authoritative (gADR-0000). Regenerate it with
# scripts/build_config.py whenever the JSON changes.

# Export / build output (e.g. macOS .app from `gda export run`).
/build/

# Godot's per-project import cache, generated by any headless/editor/export run.
# Derived, machine-local — never committed.
/.godot/

# Godot 4.4+ per-script UID sidecars, generated on import. This project references
# every script/resource by res:// PATH (gda-authored scenes and the generated
# .tres never use uid://), so these are incidental import artifacts, regenerated
# on the next import — not authored source.
*.uid
